                        "entry_id": "c86ee046-7c77-3512-8486-a8a1bb6fcd42",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Abounding with clouds, clouded, cloudy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9c0e9be-0924-4851-9a32-cd3aef22a968",
                                "sense_id": "fcac64cf-3fe0-30d5-924c-5d5a8964d783",
                                "text": "From the waterless land and flora, in the thundery landscape, the drying pitch of dayshine, the shine that was parching […] has actually there contracted suddenly vast masses of thunder clouds, into the thick thunder rainfall, from the cloudful sky."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "573c9362-3805-415b-8d40-116505945dfb",
                                "sense_id": "fcac64cf-3fe0-30d5-924c-5d5a8964d783",
                                "text": "Or does some brighter spirit, un forlorn,\nSend you, my little sister of the wood,\nTo say to some one on a cloudful morn,\n\"Life lives through death, my brother, all is good ?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d49473ca-55c9-41e7-84eb-69aac3a05a1a",
                                "sense_id": "fcac64cf-3fe0-30d5-924c-5d5a8964d783",
                                "text": "Cities at night, and cloudful skies, I've wanted; […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f1ab63a8-118a-3764-93e2-6be1d539731c",
                        "entry_id": "c86ee046-7c77-3512-8486-a8a1bb6fcd42",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dark, dimmed; troubled, turbid."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3fb26c6d-47a5-43e3-9c02-63e805237e4d",
                                "sense_id": "f1ab63a8-118a-3764-93e2-6be1d539731c",
                                "text": "His words, accordingly, proceeding from a mind \"in a dark, hot, cloudful state,\" were \"metallic, meteoric, ball-like.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
